  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi, currently as it is most humanoid avatars have no problem when it comes to having a visible body. But with more abnormal avatars (such as a tank) the avatar can end up blocking the viewpoint which gets really frustrating alot of the time. My suggestion is a simple hotkey that makes your avatar invisible to yourself and replaces your hands with floating Vive Controllers (or whatever controller is being used).",
